# Closed unit cube: 8 shared vertices, 12 triangles, consistently wound outward.
#
# The counterpart to cube.obj, which splits every corner so each face can carry
# the full texture and is therefore six disconnected patches. This one is a single
# closed manifold (V - E + F = 8 - 18 + 12 = 2), so it is the mesh to reach for
# when testing topology: Euler characteristic, orientation, closed-surface
# handling, or anything that must reject a boundary. Small enough to check by hand.
#
# No UVs — use cube.obj for texturing.

v -0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v  0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v  0.5  0.5 -0.5
v -0.5  0.5 -0.5
v -0.5 -0.5  0.5
v  0.5 -0.5  0.5
v  0.5  0.5  0.5
v -0.5  0.5  0.5

# -z
f 1 4 3
f 1 3 2
# +z
f 5 6 7
f 5 7 8
# -y
f 1 2 6
f 1 6 5
# +y
f 4 7 3
f 4 8 7
# -x
f 1 5 8
f 1 8 4
# +x
f 2 3 7
f 2 7 6
